    "problems": "The IOI evidence is limited to GPT-2 and MIB faithfulness metrics; it does not directly test head roles or the original circuit. The authors report that ILP scales poorly and that the optimal positive-edge ratio varies by model and task. No uncertainty estimates are given for the reported scores.",
    "rows_left_out": "No rows omitted under the 60-row limit. Results for Qwen-2.5, Gemma-2, MCQA and ARC-E are outside the IOI-specific versions recorded here.",
